 "text": "Stores sequence of input samples in first in, first out (FIFO) register, 4 inputs, 4 outputs, {Push onto full register} sets Overflow condition; {Register size} sets the number of entries, {Mode} sets the operation mode, {The ratio of output sample time to input sample time} sets the sample rate ratio, {Pop empty register} sets the underflow condition, {Show empty register indicator port (Empty)} sets the optional empty port, {Show full register indicator port (Full)} sets the optional full port, {Show number of register entries port (Num)} sets the optional num port and {Local reset port} sets the optional reset port. Values come from the instance.",
